{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問荅不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉公案不錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丙寅冬制法主曾克安隱首座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣感夢懷疑，師直示其旨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸方目為四殺雄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解云：\n\n各有二字，最為親切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解云：逐一指點一遍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解云：祖佛苦心，可悲可痛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解云：此豈不是五家宗旨之法信麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解云：此非七佛歷祖等偈麼？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拈云：須向者裏參透始得。今時洞宗只為不參者箇。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和雲門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本諱朱鷺，字白民"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喑𠾐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今生居士請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "狀云五歲，誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "弘儲居家時，自號仲連居士。法語末後云：「如金剛鎚擊破萬法，那時來見老僧，猶當\n三十年給侍在。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺先請雲門湛和尚結制，湛曰：\n「能致新北禪為第一座，我來；北禪不允，我不來。」武林護法合詞來請，北禪一眾不悅和尚行，和尚曰：\n「嘗以戒事請益。」諾之。抵安隱，則雲門先一日化去，浙之士大夫緇白踊躍曰：「雲門有深意。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後改\n名忍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "易字三關"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "李公死璫禍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "榖，長洲人，後遇敗舟，趺坐水中死，和尚痛惜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丙寅冬制，法主曾領眾安\n隱云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亞僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常浩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智達"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坦然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "神照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚴峻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道一"}
